OL,3,GNEWSAGang member who targeted cashpoint
OL,4,Ausers deported
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Colombian man who was part of a gang
OL,7,Fwhich stole #64,000 from older people
OL,8,Fwithdrawing cash has been deported.
OL,10,FAlong with his associates, Armet Cortes
OL,11,Fwould linger around cash machines and
OL,12,Fbanks before selecting vulnerable
OL,13,Fvictims, such as lone women.
OL,15,FHaving targeted 14 people in locations
OL,16,Fincluding Sunderland, Newcastle and
OL,17,FHexham, he pleaded guilty to conspiracy
OL,18,Fto steal and was jailed in September
OL,19,F2025 for three years and eight months.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
